companies produce the best product leaders. And&nbsp;
I've been doing this by looking at which alumni&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:48.160 --> 01:04:54.080
of companies go on to become CPOs at the highest&nbsp;
rate, get promoted the most at their next job,&nbsp;&nbsp;

