01:06:31.200 --> 01:06:36.960
broader skill sets beyond designing wireframes&nbsp;
and interviewing some customers. They really own&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:36.960 --> 01:06:44.480
it like a mini CEO to some degree. I think there's&nbsp;
one other thing which is part to our approach was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:44.480 --> 01:06:53.200
this deeply first principles thinking methodology&nbsp;
