01:07:14.880 --> 01:07:22.960
success for an event like that? How does the user&nbsp;
or the attendee define value? What other things&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:22.960 --> 01:07:30.160
do those people find valuable? We create these&nbsp;
complex systems to try and approach everything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:30.160 --> 01:07:36.240
but the net effect was we'd have really joined&nbsp;
up considered strategy and it's everywhere.&nbsp;

01:07:36.240 --> 01:07:41.120
Like Paul Adams, our chief product officer,&nbsp;
I didn't even plan to show this. He made this&nbsp;&nbsp;

