all that stuff. So, yeah, it's just all that good&nbsp;
energy product, product energy, first principles,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:33.600 --> 01:08:39.760
the people we chose. And on the founders&nbsp;
side, I was talking to Des about this morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

